{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is reachable, grab and move. If visible, approach and move. Check properties in order to decide. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveAlongWithObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLight    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
